			<div class="content" id="post-content-2238297">
									

<p>Had to -1 this one. Its just a weird thing, doing weird things, and not particularly well written. This is a giant predatory bird next to a motorway, what happens if one day it gets a taste for cars or mopeds? If such an SCP existed then I doubt the Foundation would view it so laxly. I think either the Containment Procedures need to be updated (possibly just apply restraints for the type of bird in the relative size, such as hawking hoods, etc) or the SCP needs to be updated to show why they're allowing it such free rein.</p>
<p>I think a hood on its head and a steel cable welded to its ankle would probably stop it from buggering off. If its truly emulating a hawk it wouldnt want to take off without being able to see.</p>

